&lt;p&gt;We are &lt;strong&gt;Boosta, a holding tech company&lt;/strong&gt; that creates, develops, and invests in digital businesses with global potential. Today, we collaborate with over 800 specialists from different parts of the world, and millions of users use our products and services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Currently, we are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;AI Artist | 2D Illustrator &lt;/strong&gt;to join our product IT company Honeytech, which is developing a platform in the webcomics industry and producing unique content for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100+ professionals on the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3x growth over the past year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;22M+ users worldwide use our product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Honeytech is a dynamic, fast-growing project that has already become #1 in its niche! Imagine Netflix, but for comics — in just a few years, we’ve gathered over 15 million users, challenged giants from South Korea, and proven that it’s possible to build a world-class product from Ukraine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As an AI Artist | 2D Illustrator, your challenges will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing the Director’s Script and Creative Brief to clearly understand the visual task.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating high-quality AI-generated static visual materials (Static Shots) using approved tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring shot-to-shot visual consistency within an episode, including the consistency of character styles, environments, objects, composition, color palette, and lighting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refining materials based on feedback from the Creative Producer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing the final package of static materials for handover to the Animation Production stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizing source materials, prompts, and working files according to internal standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing the internal prompt library and reusable visual solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously researching and proposing new tools and approaches to improve product quality and optimize processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for a specialist who&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a deep understanding of and hands-on experience with AI generators such as Midjourney, Stable Diffusion, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has advanced Prompt Engineering skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has confident proficiency in Adobe Photoshop, including compositing, color correction, and fixing generative artifacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has knowledge of composition, color theory, light, and shadow fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands the graphics preparation pipeline for further animation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your journey with us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 1. Pre-screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 2. Test task.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 3. Interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 4. Reference check.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 5. Job Offer!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we offer?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote &lt;strong&gt;freelance&lt;/strong&gt; work on a cool project on a long-term basis — this is not project-based cooperation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the most competitive Tier-1 markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with professionals who understand the importance of clear, specific briefs without unnecessary abstractions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 working days of vacation per year and up to 10 sick days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to top AI tools and the freedom to experiment, learn, and deepen your expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Most importantly, Honeytech is a team of professionals where everyone feels supported and achieves their goals!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the team and build a New Chapter together with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;", "departments": [{"id": 4078144101, "name": "Honeytech", "child_ids": [], "parent_id": null}], "offices": [{"id": 4049425101, "name": "Remote UA", "location": null, "child_ids": [], "parent_id": null}], "ai_disclaimer": null, "include_ai_disclaimer": false, "ai_opt_out_request_url": "http://s101.recruiting.eu.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/5000013101/ai_opt_out"}, {"absolute_url": "https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/boosta/jobs/5011056101", "data_compliance": [{"type": "gdpr", "requires_consent": false, "requires_processing_consent": false, "requires_retention_consent": false, "retention_period": null, "demographic_data_consent_applies": false}], "internal_job_id": 4539673101, "location": {"name": "Remote, Europe; Remote, Ukraine"}, "metadata": [{"id": 15235413101, "name": "Priority", "value": "Regular", "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 15235890101, "name": "Responsibilities", "value": ""• Create ad creatives based on briefs
