&lt;p&gt;We are &lt;strong&gt;Boosta, a holding tech company&lt;/strong&gt; that creates, develops, and invests in digital businesses with global potential. Today, we collaborate with over 800 specialists from different parts of the world, and millions of users use our products and services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re currently looking for an &lt;strong&gt;AI Creative Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to join a business that is developing an AI-powered platform for creating advertising creatives and launching digital campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The product automates key stages of the digital advertising process — from creating ad creatives to launching and optimizing campaigns. It enables businesses to test advertising ideas faster, launch more campaigns, and identify which creatives perform best with their audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will be your focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-quality ad creatives for paid social campaigns based on briefs, marketing goals, and ad performance insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop visual concepts and produce videos, images, animations, music, and voiceovers using AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with AI tools and workflows to create fresh, engaging ad creatives that capture the audience&#39;s attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently propose original ideas, visual solutions, and creative concepts that go beyond the initial brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Creative and Product teams on developing and improving ad creatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt ad materials to different formats, placements, and campaign requirements, including Meta Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively on multiple tasks at the same time, maintain high quality of work, and meet deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on experience creating visual and video content with AI for advertising or digital marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with AI tools such as Kling, Veo, Higgsfield, Suno, ElevenLabs, and Lovart, as well as CapCut for editing and post-production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience collaborating with Creative and Product teams in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the specifics of ad creatives for paid social and ad formats, particularly on Meta platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong creative thinking and the ability to turn briefs into engaging and effective visual concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can organize your work independently, set priorities, and deliver high-quality results within tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are ready to experiment with new AI tools, techniques, and approaches to content creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a portfolio with examples of AI creatives, videos, or advertising projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what our hiring process looks like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 1. Pre-screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 2. Technical interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 3. Job Offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s waiting for you at Boosta?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlock your potential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a product from the ground up and have a say in key decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in an environment that gives you the freedom and space to take action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow alongside strong A-players who share their expertise and are always ready to boost each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep learning through internal and external talks, courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choose your own rhythm:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work remotely or from our office in Kyiv or coworking spaces in Lviv and Warsaw.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan your workday your way — we offer a flexible schedule because results matter most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take time to recharge: 28 working days of annual vacation, up to 30 days of sick leave, plus all public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Need more flexibility? You can move a working day to a weekend and vice versa when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep your balance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take care of your health with medical insurance, our Mental Health program, and compensation for psychological support sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get involved in socially impactful initiatives, including our Ukrainian Victory Support program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Celebrate important moments — receive gifts for meaningful milestones in your personal and professional life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join quarterly team-building activities, both online and offline — because strong teams are built beyond work, too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to build from scratch? Make your ambition happen here.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;", "departments": [{"id": 4083043101, "name": "AI adsmaker", "child_ids": [], "parent_id": null}], "offices": [{"id": 4051154101, "name": "Remote Global", "location": null, "child_ids": [], "parent_id": null}], "ai_disclaimer": null, "include_ai_disclaimer": false, "ai_opt_out_request_url": "http://s101.recruiting.eu.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/5011056101/ai_opt_out"}, {"absolute_url": "https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/boosta/jobs/4979497101", "data_compliance": [{"type": "gdpr", "requires_consent": false, "requires_processing_consent": false, "requires_retention_consent": false, "retention_period": null, "demographic_data_consent_applies": false}], "internal_job_id": 4523622101, "location": {"name": "Remote, Ukraine"}, "metadata": [{"id": 15235413101, "name": "Priority", "value": "Medium", "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 15235890101, "name": "Responsibilities", "value": "-Полный цикл ASO-оптимизации приложений в App Store и Google Play.
