&lt;li&gt;Simultaneous management and development of a portfolio of 30+ mobile applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development and optimization of text metadata (Title, Subtitle, Keywords, Short/Long Description) based on performance analysis and search queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparation of technical tasks for designers for the creation and optimization of ASO creatives (icons, screenshots, promotional materials).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with ASA and incentivized traffic for testing and increasing the effectiveness of ASO hypotheses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of application ratings and reputation: organization of the purchase of ratings and reviews, control of their quality and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market analysis, competitor analysis, and current App Store and Google Play trends, search for new promising brands/product combinations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generation, testing, and implementation of ASO hypotheses aimed at increasing organic traffic and key product metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring of results, preparation of reports, presentation of work results, and identification of growth areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in team meetings, strategy discussions, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What matters to us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full cycle of ASO optimization in the App Store and Google Play.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simultaneous management of 30+ applications.&lt;/li&gt;
