&lt;p&gt;We are &lt;strong&gt;Boosta, a holding tech company&lt;/strong&gt; that creates, develops, and invests in digital businesses with global potential. Today, we collaborate with over 800 specialists from different parts of the world, and millions of users use our products and services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe that outstanding results start with a great company culture. That’s why we invest time, ideas, and resources into events and gifts that bring people together. We are currently looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Event &amp;amp; Production Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to own our events, corporate gifts, and &lt;strong&gt;Boosta Shop &amp;amp; Coins&lt;/strong&gt; loyalty program — delivering meaningful experiences with a true “wow” effect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important:&lt;/strong&gt; We are looking for a specialist based in &lt;strong&gt;Kyiv&lt;/strong&gt;, as most of our events take place there. Office attendance is not required, so you&#39;ll be able to work remotely most of the time. You should also be ready for business trips across Ukraine and abroad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team: manage and mentor a team of four specialists, distribute tasks, and support their professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic planning: develop the long-term roadmap for the function, align it with Boosta’s business goals, and effectively manage budgets and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead large-scale events (internal and external): oversee the organization of major corporate events, conference booths, and other large-scale initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize the CEO Club: take ownership of the organizational part of our take ownership of the biannual C-level event held in different countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage gift and merchandise production: from corporate gifts and event merchandise to exclusive branded gifts created by our businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Boosta Shop &amp;amp; Coins — our internal loyalty program, which has been recognized with the People First Award.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize and automate processes: improve internal workflows to ensure the team operates efficiently and smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track analytics and performance metrics: measure the effectiveness of events and projects using data and feedback to continuously improve future initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re a great match if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong leadership experience: 3–4+ years in the event industry, including leading large-scale projects and managing budgets (experience in creative/event agencies or IT companies will be a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think strategically: understand how internal events and corporate gifts contribute to employer branding, employee engagement, and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have production expertise: stay up to date with merchandise, textile, and promotional product trends and have a strong visual taste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine creativity with structure: thrive in a multitasking environment, consistently meet deadlines, and take full ownership of your work and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are ready to speak with the world: have fluent Ukrainian and Upper-Intermediate (B2) or higher English, as you&#39;ll collaborate with vendors from different parts of the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plenty of opportunities for professional growth and self-realization alongside a team of experienced experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional and personal support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A convenient time-off policy: 28 paid vacation days, 30 paid sick leave days with medical confirmation, transfer days that allow you to move working days, and all public holidays preserved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;80% reimbursement for professional courses, access to our internal learning platform with courses and guides, and a dedicated management development program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance, mental health webinars, and individual consultations with a psychologist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A corporate discount program with favorite brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boosta Shop&lt;/strong&gt; — our internal marketplace where you can purchase branded merchandise or tech devices, including smartphones, laptops, coffee machines, and smartwatches, using Boosta Coins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team buildings, internal events, and corporate gifts for special occasions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;", "departments": [{"id": 4078157101, "name": "Head Office - Communications", "child_ids": [4078802101, 4078801101, 4078158101], "parent_id": 4078143101}], "offices": [{"id": 4049423101, "name": "Kyiv", "location": "Київ, Київська область, Україна", "child_ids": [], "parent_id": null}], "ai_disclaimer": null, "include_ai_disclaimer": false, "ai_opt_out_request_url": "http://s101.recruiting.eu.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/4973375101/ai_opt_out"}, {"absolute_url": "https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/boosta/jobs/4975647101", "data_compliance": [{"type": "gdpr", "requires_consent": false, "requires_processing_consent": false, "requires_retention_consent": false, "retention_period": null, "demographic_data_consent_applies": false}], "internal_job_id": null, "location": {"name": "Kyiv, Ukraine; Lviv, Ukraine; Remote, Europe; Remote, Ukraine; Warsaw, Poland"}, "metadata": [{"id": 15235413101, "name": "Priority", "value": null, "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 15235890101, "name": "Responsibilities", "value": null, "value_type": "long_text"}, {"id": 15532769101, "name": "BU Lifecycle Stage", "value": null, "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 15532770101, "name": "Recruitment Mode", "value": null, "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 15683159101, "name": "Job Category", "value": null, "value_type": "single_select"}], "id": 4975647101, "updated_at": "2026-10-29T04:16:46-04:00", "requisition_id": null, "title": "Founder (Web2App • Mobile Apps • Affiliation)", "company_name": "Boosta", "first_published": "2026-09-14T09:45:49-04:00", "language": "en", "application_deadline": null, "content": "&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
