&lt;li&gt;Team hiring/leadership (UA, product, design, content, engineering).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;payments (Store policies, GDPR; Apple/Google IAP + Stripe for web).&lt;/li&gt;
