&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record scaling a&amp;nbsp;consumer subscription app or&amp;nbsp;web2app funnel to&amp;nbsp;meaningful revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on growth expertise (paid UA, ASO, affiliates) and experiment velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytics mindset (MMP: AppsFlyer/Adjust; GA4/Amplitude/Mixpanel; Excel; SQL nice-to-have).&lt;/li&gt;
