&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in&amp;nbsp;Utilities/Health &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Fitness/Entertainment categories.&lt;/li&gt;
