&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Firebase, Segment, BigQuery/Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-founder track: meaningful equity + profit share.&lt;/li&gt;
