&lt;li&gt;Fast decisions: direct access to&amp;nbsp;MP; zero bureaucracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first: flexible, Kyiv office access, conference support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
