&lt;p&gt;We are &lt;strong&gt;Boosta, a holding tech company&lt;/strong&gt; that creates, develops, and invests in digital businesses with global potential. Today, we collaborate with over 800 specialists from different parts of the world, and millions of users use our products and services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are currently looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Head of Commercial (Merchant Sales &amp;amp; Portfolio Growth)&lt;/strong&gt; to join Flintn, a business building and scaling an all-in-one payment platform for online businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flintn is a promising early-stage project, and at this point we already have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an MVP with core functionality;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;first customers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a clear product vision;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a strong team;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;well-established processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Next comes a strong growth focus: product development, testing, and integrations aimed at building a global payment platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be focusing on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To build and later lead our commercial function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New merchant acquisition across the European, North American and LatAm markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead generation: outbound, partnerships, ISV and platform channels, events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Account Management function — retention, expansion, processed-volume growth, and the authorisation-rate value we deliver to merchants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial process: ICP, playbooks, pricing discipline, CRM hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting of sales and growth in turnover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring and coaching as the function grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform growth commitments and targets fulfilments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are our ideal candidate if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fintech understanding, auth-rate and routing narrative, writing playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interchange and scheme economics, bank/acquirer relationships, pricing understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built pipeline/function from nothing; can name the first touch, the first playbook, the first hire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands orchestration levers; auth-rate diagnosis; current VAMP thresholds; MID/acquirer landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
