&lt;p&gt;We work in two directions: &lt;strong&gt;venture building&lt;/strong&gt; — launching new businesses together with ambitious founders, taking on the operational workload and financing, and &lt;strong&gt;private equity&lt;/strong&gt; — helping mature businesses reach their next stage of growth through capital and strategic support.&lt;/p&gt;
