&lt;li&gt;Lead generation: sourcing people, companies, and deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial modeling (basic level):&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the relationship between the three financial statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building cash flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding: revenue → expenses → net profit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fundamental financial analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring of relevant companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with data analytics on relevant projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio management processes support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal support (assistance, not closing deals independently).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that matters to us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial modeling and analytics: understanding of financial statements and the ability to build financial models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analysis: working with data and its analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unit-economics analytics: basic understanding of unit economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What our hiring process looks like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 1. Pre-screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 2. Interview.&lt;/li&gt;
