&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance and compensation for sessions with a psychologist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ukrainian Victory Support program and other important social initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We celebrate important moments together — we give gifts for special occasions in your life and career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly team buildings (online or offline).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
