&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspirio by the numbers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20+ applications in finance, health, wellness, and utility niches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5M+ downloads of our products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3x growth in active users over the past 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;35 core team members and a network of external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your focus will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the Meta Ads acquisition strategy for mobile apps and web landing pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Meta Ads budget planning and forecasting, including quarter / monthly spend, revenue and profitability targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own traffic volume, profitability and overall performance of the Meta Ads channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, launch, optimize and scale advertising campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and maintain tracking, attribution and data flow between Meta, apps, web landing pages and affiliate platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance, identify growth opportunities and turn insights into actionable hypotheses and tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize acquisition funnels to improve conversion rates and unit economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operationalize a scalable creative marketing process, establishing a consistent flow of creative production, testing, analysis, iteration and scaling of winning concepts in collaboration with the Design team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop the Meta Ads team, including hiring, onboarding, mentoring and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish efficient processes, workflows and performance standards for the media buying function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with ASO, Developers, Design and Affiliate teams to drive overall acquisition performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with Meta Ads platform changes, policies and industry trends, and adapt the acquisition strategy accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re our ideal candidate if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of hands-on Meta Ads experience, including 1+ year in a senior/leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and managing a media buying team from scratch, including processes, performance standards and team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with budget allocation across GEOs, products, campaigns and acquisition funnels based on performance and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with acquisition across iOS and Android apps and web landing pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of scaling ad budgets while maintaining target profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Meta Ads campaign setup, optimization, testing and scaling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of tracking, attribution, and managing Meta Business infrastructure, including Meta Pixel, CAPI, events, postbacks, third-party integrations, multiple ad accounts, pixels/datasets, domains and account health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with full-funnel performance analysis across ads, landing pages, apps and partner conversions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in creative strategy and performance-driven creative testing, including creative testing frameworks, hypothesis development, angles, hooks, UGC, static and video formats, creative fatigue, winner iteration, testing velocity and creative analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking, ownership and commercial mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Will be a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with challenging verticals - FinTech, affiliate or lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with other paid acquisition channels - Google Ads, TikTok Ads, native advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in our hiring process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 1. Pre-screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 2. Interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 3. Technical interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 4. Test assignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 5. Final interview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 6. Reference check.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 7.&amp;nbsp; Job Offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get from working with us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fast-paced, dynamic environment with daily challenges and opportunities for professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong manager support and trust — no micromanagement.&lt;/li&gt;
