&lt;li&gt;Identify, research, and engage potential clients through relevant channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a healthy sales pipeline, ensuring consistent progress toward revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct discovery calls to understand customer needs, business challenges, and decision-making processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop tailored sales proposals and communicate the business value of solutions to potential clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead negotiations, handle objections, and develop commercial agreements that meet both customer needs and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with clients, identifying opportunities for account growth and long-term partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor sales performance, maintain accurate CRM data, and provide reliable pipeline forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve sales processes, messaging, and outreach strategies based on performance data and market feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
